module change-thompson-v-ins.doctrine

// The overruled precedent (docs/litigate/CHANGE.md §4): Thompson's
// "unique circumstances", stated as the fact it turns on and the excuse it
// gives.

/// The district court assured the appellant that a post-trial motion was
/// timely, and the appellant relied on it (Thompson v. INS, 375 U.S. 384).
event TimelinessAssured()

/// Where the court assured the appellant that the post-trial motion was
/// timely, the late notice of appeal is excused.
default unique-circumstances cite "Thompson v. INS, 375 U.S. 384" when has_event(TimelinessAssured()) => true
